  "prefLabel": "Plc 2104.05 Issuance of Evaluator’s Opinion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2104.05 Issuance of Evaluator’s Opinion.\n\n(a) At the conclusion of the session, the neutral evaluator shall issue an oral opinion that contains a suggested settlement or disposition and the reasons therefor.\n\n(b) The neutral evaluator shall mail a written report of the opinion and suggestion(s) to the parties within 48 hours of the session, excluding Saturdays, Sundays, and state or federal holidays.\n\nSource. #14331, eff 8-20-25, EXPIRES: 8-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2100.html"
